	(text "POWER INPUT: J1 (panel jack leads) -> F1 2A slow-blow -> J7 (panel switch loop) -> +24V bus" (at 1000 1900 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5d47d0aa-7e76-47a8-8878-b78ac4719b7f"))
	(text "LOGIC POWER: IRM-02-5 24V->5V, AMS1117 5V->3V3. VERIFY IRM-02-5 PINOUT VS DATASHEET." (at 1000 3700 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f7acabdf-840f-45d5-bdbd-991bbc32f884"))
	(text "ESP32-C3 SuperMini plugs onto J6. GPIO0-3 -> 1k -> CTRL_x; 100k pull-downs keep LEDs off during boot." (at 1000 6300 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2a44d460-3e1f-404e-9bae-548761bcc516"))
	(text "LED DRIVER CHANNELS (7x AL8860WT-7, TSOT-25). High-side sense: +24V -> RSET -> SET pin = LED string anode; string cathode -> L -> SW; D freewheels SW -> +24V. I_LED = 0.1V / RSET." (at 4200 1700 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "62b54bc6-552a-4e6b-90bd-66548c8be13b"))
	(text "MCPCB HEADERS: J2-J5 -> LED boards. Red chain J2>J3>J4>J5, blue J2>J3, deep-red J4>J5 (series joins on this PCB)." (at 4200 6700 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1ed6122e-cb70-45c0-885c-6195fd23d0f4"))
	(text "AL8860 RESOLVED 2026-09-08: 'AL8860W6-7 SOT-23-6' DOES NOT EXIST (LCSC C460356 = AP3012 boost, wrong part). Use AL8860WT-7 TSOT-25, LCSC C125330. Pinout per DS39014: 1=SW 2=GND 3=CTRL 4=SET 5=VIN." (at 1000 11500 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ac3d74bc-5b45-49b1-a708-cf0ea0884847"))
